        "title": "Awesome Experience",
        "text": "We visited the Pashupatinath Temple twice. Once the guide took us in the evening stating the doors would be closed in the morning. When we reached at around 4.30 pm, only one main door of the temple was open. Rest most temples in the compound were closed. \nThe next time we went in the morning at around 10.30 am. All 4 doors were open and we witnessed the grand abhishek of the shiva linga. Surreal experience.\nBetter to check the timing when the 4 doors are open.\n",
